zeroemu's binary and release archive include no code from Google or the Android
Open Source Project. zeroemu loads the Android Emulator's GPU renderer
(libgfxstream_backend) and reads Android system images from the user's own Android
SDK installation; those are covered by Google's Android SDK terms, not by this
licence.

testdata/sepolicy_mini.cil, used only by unit tests, holds declarations taken
from the SELinux policy in an Android SDK system image. That policy comes from
the Android Open Source Project (system/sepolicy and the emulator's device
policy), which publishes it as open source.
